WEBVTT

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:05.648
<v><b>Examiner:</b></v> Good morning, Ms Jones.

00:00:05.922 --> 00:00:08.048
<v><b>Anna:</b></v> Er, good morning.

00:00:08.049 --> 00:00:10.198
I’m very nervous.

00:00:10.199 --> 00:00:12.509
<v><b>Examiner:</b></v> Can you start the car, please?

00:00:12.917 --> 00:00:13.703
<v><b>Anna:</b></v> OK.

00:00:27.901 --> 00:00:30.712
<v><b>Examiner:</b></v> OK. Turn right.

00:00:31.062 --> 00:00:33.211
Right, not left.

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:34.666
<v><b>Anna:</b></v> Sorry!

00:00:35.491 --> 00:00:39.401
<v><b>Examiner:</b></v> The traffic lights are red! Stop!

00:00:40.788 --> 00:00:44.769
OK, can you park the car, please?

00:00:44.873 --> 00:00:46.630
<v><b>Anna:</b></v> Can I park here?

00:00:46.836 --> 00:00:52.702
<v><b>Examiner:</b></v> No, you can’t. Look, it’s no parking. Park over there.

00:00:53.416 --> 00:00:56.082
<v><b>Anna:</b></v> Sorry. I’m very nervous.

00:00:57.296 --> 00:01:03.121
<v><b>Examiner:</b></v> Well, Ms Jones, I’m sorry but you need more driving lessons.